data: {"id": "aff56ad0a7dd4334-thinking-parallel_evidence-718", "run_id": "aff56ad0a7dd4334", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 |\n|---|---|\n| **Kubernetes Describe** | Pod `workload` 被调度到 `node2`，Phase=`Pending`；容器 `app` 状态 `Waiting / ContainerCreating`，Restart=0；**Volume `input` 类型 Secret，SecretName=`unavailable-input` (Optional=false)**。 |\n| **Kubernetes YAML** | 确认 volume `input` 为 Secret volume，引用 `SecretName: unavailable-input`；无 `imagePullSecrets`；无 Node-Selector；`PodScheduled=True`（说明不是调度失败）。 |\n| **Kubernetes Events** | `FailedMount` (x23 over 38m): **\"MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume 'inp", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789119718194, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

